  "scope": "Extend the existing strict same-version, selected default-appearance IMAGE graph from 32 to 64 images, with at most 64 retained IMAGE and IMAGEDEF source frames per kind.",
  "implementation": [
    "Use a shared 4 MiB logical budget for retained IMAGE and IMAGEDEF source snapshots, charging map/object and vector elements, string and variant payloads. The counter is incremented only after successful insertion and reset by metadata clear; per-record logical payload remains bounded at 64 KiB.",
    "Permit up to 128 groups only in IMAGEDEF source frames, to cover the reactor list of heavily shared definitions; IMAGE frames remain limited to 64 groups. The common source admission helper and graph count use the same metadata limits.",
    "Keep source, typed/live, identity/owner/reactor and staged-output checks in force. 65 images, unresolved graph profiles and legacy IMAGE graphs with MATERIAL remain refused."
  ],
  "validation": {
    "platform": "macOS ARM64, Qt offscreen; loaded libdxfrw dylib SHA-256 a18e2367e0bc5727c7e8021ef7694230446c52972e0a7ae1856700c58bb1a099, whose src matches current libdxfrw head.",
    "controls": "Red-before 33-image save refusal reproduced. Shared-budget test passes 139 assertions, including combined-map exhaustion, per-kind 64/65 boundaries, 128/129 IMAGEDEF and 64/65 IMAGE groups, and reset. Six-version image-boundary test passes 1,110 assertions including 33, 64 and 65 images, owner/late-mutation failures, destination preservation and corrected same-filter retries.",
    "adjacent": "The earlier exact production candidate passed 12,453 assertions in 24 MATERIAL/IMAGE cases; the subsequent change added only the 65-image retry test. Current bundled-codec filter translation unit compiled.",
    "independent": "ezdxf 1.4.5 compared 30 generated source/output pairs: 24 model-space graphs (33 or 64 images with 1, 4 or 64 definitions across six versions), two 64-image model/block graphs, and four 64-image graphs containing MATERIAL and 3D image vectors. Every image, definition, owner, reactor and reciprocal link was checked; source/output geometry and paths matched, with clean audits. The heavily shared IMAGEDEF contained 75 source groups."
  },
